{"path":"experimental/search","title":"std::experimental::search","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>search","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/search","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Searches the sequence [first, last) for the pattern specified in the constructor of searcher.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/algorithm&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> ForwardIterator, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Searcher <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>ForwardIterator search<span class=\"br0\">(</span> ForwardIterator first, ForwardIterator last,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Searcher<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> searcher <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Searches the sequence <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">first</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code><code>)</code></span> for the pattern specified in the constructor of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">searcher</span></code>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx17\"><td>\n<p>Effectively executes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">searcher<span class=\"br0\">(</span>first, last<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx17\">(until C++17)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx17\"><td>\n<p>Effectively executes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">searcher<span class=\"br0\">(</span>first, last<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">first</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><code>Searcher</code> need not be <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CopyConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CopyConstructible</em></a>. \n</p><p>The standard library provides the following searchers:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/default_searcher\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>default_searcher</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  standard C++ library search algorithm implementation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/boyer_moore_searcher\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>boyer_moore_searcher</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  Boyer-Moore search algorithm implementation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/boyer_moore_horspool_searcher\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>boyer_moore_horspool_searcher</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  Boyer-Moore-Horspool search algorithm implementation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete </div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns the result of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">searcher.<span class=\"me1\">operator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, that is, an iterator to the location at which the substring is found or a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code> if it was not found.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Depends on the searcher.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/functional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> in <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed \"</span>\n                     <span class=\"st0\">\"do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> needle <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"pisci\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> it <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">search</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>in.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, in.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n                  <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/boyer_moore_searcher\"><span class=\"kw2339\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">make_boyer_moore_searcher</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n                      needle.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, needle.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>it <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> in.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The string \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> needle <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" found at offset \"</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> it <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> in.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The string \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> needle <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" not found<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The string pisci found at offset 43</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/search\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>search</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  searches for the first occurrence of a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::search","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Searches the sequence [first, last) for the pattern specified in the constructor of searcher."},{"label":"Parameters"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns the result of searcher.operator(), that is, an iterator to the location at which the substring is found or a copy of last if it was not found."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Depends on the searcher."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"search","note":"searches for the first occurrence of a range of elements"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":229,"codeBlockCount":2}
